# source: spec
# spec: docs/protocol/compression-header.md#layout
# provenance: PV-0060, PV-0061, PV-0062, PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066, PV-0067, PV-0068
# kind: compression-header
# description: LZH header for 258 uncompressed bytes at level 2; 258 = 0x0102 tells a little-endian reading from a big-endian one.
# derivation: 258 as u32 LE = 02 01 00 00 (PV-0061, PV-0062); 0x12 = version 1, algorithm 2 = LZH (PV-0063, PV-0064, PV-0066); magic 1F 9D (PV-0067); byte 7 = level 2 (PV-0068).
# expect.error: none
# expect.uncompressed_length: 258
# expect.algorithm: lzh
# expect.version: 1
# expect.level: 2
hex:
02 01 00 00                                       # uncompressed length, u32 LE
12                                                # algorithm byte
1F 9D                                             # magic
02                                                # byte 7
